{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsource\/isvolatile"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"isVolatile","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSource(py)isVolatile"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource\/isVolatile","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the tiles this source loads are kept out of persistent storage."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"getter"},{"kind":"text","text":"="},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"setter"},{"kind":"text","text":"="},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setVolatile:"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"type":"text","text":", tiles of this source are neither written to nor read from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ambient cache on disk, whatever the response’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Cache-Control"},{"type":"text","text":" header says;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they are held in memory for as long as the map needs them. Use it for content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose terms forbid storing it, or that must not outlive the session. Other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources, such as a TileJSON file the source is configured with, are still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cached. The default is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set it before adding the source to a style, so that no tile is requested"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under the old setting."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSource":{"title":"MLNSource","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsource","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNSource"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract base class for map content sources. A map content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source supplies content to be shown on the map. A source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"foreground style layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source."}